{"s":96,"name":"Al-Alaq","meaning":"The Clot","arName":"سُورَةُ العَلَقِ","type":"Meccan","verses":19,"juz":30,"page":597,"basmala":true,"ayahs":[{"a":1,"ar":"ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","en":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created -","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":2,"ar":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","en":"Created man from a clinging substance.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":3,"ar":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","en":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","en":"Who taught by the pen -","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":5,"ar":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","en":"Taught man that which he knew not.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":6,"ar":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","en":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":7,"ar":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","en":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":8,"ar":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","en":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":9,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","en":"Have you seen the one who forbids","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":10,"ar":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","en":"A servant when he prays?","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":11,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","en":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":12,"ar":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","en":"Or enjoins righteousness?","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":13,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","en":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away -","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":14,"ar":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","en":"Does he not know that Allah sees?","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":15,"ar":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","en":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock -","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":16,"ar":"نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ","en":"A lying, sinning forelock.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":17,"ar":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","en":"Then let him call his associates;","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":18,"ar":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","en":"We will call the angels of Hell.","juz":30,"page":597},{"a":19,"ar":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","en":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah].","juz":30,"page":597}]}